<title>FINLAND: NESTE TRADE CONTINUES, SHARE RISES.</title>
<headline>NESTE TRADE CONTINUES, SHARE RISES.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade in Finnish oil and energy group Neste Oy started at 1504/1204 GMT, the Helsinki Stock Exchange said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Neste opened flat at 138.00 markka but quickly rose to 145.00 markka, up 7.00 markka or over five percent, after Neste said the government would study broadening Neste's and Imatran Voima's ownership base and joint developing of the two groups.</p>
<p>Trade was thin at just over one million markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 242, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
